WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.707 --> 00:00:19.502
"Mr. Speaker,
will the 30s go down as the decade...

2
00:00:20.295 --> 00:00:22.589
"which witnessed the destruction...

3
00:00:22.672 --> 00:00:24.883
"and downfall of the British empire?"

4
00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.888
"That witnessed
the wanton self-destruction...

5
00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:33.558
"of the British empire?"

6
00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:37.520
"If India were granted...

7
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.482
"self-government...

8
00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:44.361
"it would mark the downfall
of the British empire."

9
00:00:46.863 --> 00:00:50.075
"It would mark and consummate...

10
00:00:51.201 --> 00:00:53.912
"the downfall of the British empire."

11
00:01:09.261 --> 00:01:11.179
Mr. Inches, you're wanted!

12
00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:14.558
On my way.

13
00:01:33.743 --> 00:01:35.579
* Good morning.
* Good morning, madam.

14
00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.415
Have to do something
about Miss Sarah's gramophone.

15
00:01:38.456 --> 00:01:41.293
I don't want to start the day
with a family altercation.

16
00:01:41.376 --> 00:01:42.794
* No, madam.
* Hello, Mommy.

17
00:01:42.878 --> 00:01:44.254
Good morning, darling.

18
00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:50.093
Inches, kindly tell my daughter
to turn off that bloody gramophone.

19
00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:52.012
Trashy music all over the house.

20
00:01:52.095 --> 00:01:53.221
There you go, sir.

21
00:01:53.805 --> 00:01:56.141
She knows I can't stand it.
Why does she do it?

22
00:01:56.224 --> 00:01:58.143
Leave it to me, sir, will you?

23
00:02:00.103 --> 00:02:01.521
Have you been drinking?

24
00:02:01.605 --> 00:02:03.690
This time of the morning, sir? Certainly not.

25
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:06.610
If you have,
I hope it's your damn whisdey and not mine.

26
00:02:10.113 --> 00:02:11.740
What time is Mrs. P coming?

27
00:02:11.823 --> 00:02:13.116
Early afternoon, sir.

28
00:02:13.158 --> 00:02:17.287
* Early afternoon? Why not this morning?
* Because you told her to come after lunch.

29
00:02:17.329 --> 00:02:19.623
Pure invention, I did nothing of the sort.

30
00:02:19.664 --> 00:02:21.541
You said you're going
to town this morning...

31
00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:23.960
so she would not be required
until after lunch.

32
00:02:24.002 --> 00:02:26.254
I've changed my mind,
I need to redraft the speech.
